== Walkthrough ==

'''NOTE: This quest requires amiable faction. Not merely amiable, but quite high amiable as Anrey at the minimum amiable may still eat your initial turn-in.'''

Marshal Anrey may be found on the second floor of the bank in a nook in the southwest corner, at 100, -135, 40.

'''To obtain [[Shark Skin]]:'''

* Go to [[Ocean of Tears]] with a Ranger or Druid friend and track sharks just off the Sisters of Erollisi Island dock. This area has the largest density of sharks.
* A single 6 minute respawn can be found offshore of East Freeport near Bait Masterson.
* Two sharks can be found in Qeynos Catacombs.
* This item also drops off of the sharks in Erudin harbor including off of [[a diseased shark]] and several [[a young shark]]s spawned from it's death (please note, diseased shark and babies give erudin faction and reduce paineel faction). This is not to be confused with the non-stackable magic version of shark skin that also drops there.

'''To obtain [[Grizzly Bear Skin]]:'''
: Go to North Karana and run big circles around the gypsy camp (check gypsy merchants first just in case), killing all grizzly bears you find. The skin is a rare drop, but kill ~20 grizzlies and you should get at least one (fast repop).

'''To obtain [[Polar Bear Skin]]:'''
: Go to [[Everfrost Peaks]]. Check the noob vendor areas as they frequently have one for sale. Otherwise, the cubs are the easiest to farm and any mob in the noob area can spawn as a cub.

'''To obtain [[Alligator Skin]]:'''
: Go to [[Innothule Swamp]] and kill [[a bull alligator]] or [[a fat alligator]]. Placeholders are [[a kobold hunter]], [[giant water moccasin]], [[a froglok forager]].

'''To obtain [[Dragoon Dirk]]:'''
: Go to [[Crushbone]] and kill [[Ambassador DVinn]], or go to [[Northern Desert of Ro]] and kill [[Dorn B`Dynn]] (lowest level mob for Dirk). The Dragoons in Nektulos and West Commons drop Dirks as well (West Commons Dragoon spawns after killing Kizdean Gix). [[Ambassador K`Ryn]] in [[Oggok]] (spawns at 8am and despawns at 8pm behind the shaman guild, Bouncer Gronk is the spawn from 8pm to 8am) always drops the dirk.

Go to [[Rivervale]] bank, go upstairs and give the skins to Marshall Anrey to receive a preliminary [[Leatherfoot Skullcap]]. Give that cap back to him along with a [[Dragoon Dirk]] and receive Leatherfoot Raider Skullcap.

Enjoy instaclick-from-inventory gate to WC

